    <sys:String x:Key="Loc.Game.GameModeDesc">Switches power plan to High/Ultimate Performance, sets 0.5 ms timer resolution, cleans Standby List and RAM, suspends selected WhiteList apps, and never touches games, anti-cheats, Steam, or VPN. Fully restored when turned off.</sys:String>
